,fx,と...Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:34.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Vmy heart feels like it's gonna burst!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:34.32,Title,,0,0,240,,Luffy and WhitebeardDialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:37.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, partner! Can't you do anything?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:40.39,Main,,0,0,0,,How is my wax power gonna help us here?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are Luffy and the others falling from the sky?Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.98,0:02:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,To answer that, we must turn back the clock a little.Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:06.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that?Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:08.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The wave stopped!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:12.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:18.01,Main,,0,0,0,,We're trapped in ice! Now we can't go anywhere at all!Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:21.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The only one who could've done this is...Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:28.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Take a look below. There's your answer.Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:30.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Old Whitebeard...Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.95,0:03:33.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The battle has already begun!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:35.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:38.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea how we can get past this!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:40.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that we've made it this far, we have to hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:43.77,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got less than three hours till they execute Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so?Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:46.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.30,0:03:50.78,Main,,0,0,0,,He wants us to slide the ship down the frozen wave?Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:55.61,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our only choice! First off, we have to break the ship out of the ice!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:03:59.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?! This is a warship! It's not gonna move that easily!Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, you moron!Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,If we work together, I know we can do this!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:08.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel like we really can...Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:13.56,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! We've got the man who's gonna conquer the world, Captain Buggy, on our side!Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:17.35,Main,,0,0,0,,If the Captain says we can do it, then I know we can!Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Calling all ships and troops.Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:25.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Our target is site TOTTZ.Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:28.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Change formation and initiate Operation Three.Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:31.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a broadcast of the Navy's plans...Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:32.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Make haste with the preparations.Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:35.69,Main,,0,0,0,,TOT... What was that about?Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:38.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Dunno... Probably some sort of code.Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:43.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Once the preparations are complete, we'll push the schedule forward and execute Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.37,0:04:44.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Over!Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:49.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:50.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.50,0:04:54.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Vwe can't wait any longer. There's no time to argue about this!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:57.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Vwe're going with Straw Hat-boy's idea!Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.58,0:05:02.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:09.52,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:13.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Wrong way!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:20.94,Main,,0,0,0,,That brings us back to the present, where Luffy and the others are falling.Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:56.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?! Was that a warship falling out of the sky?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:00.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It's water... We're saved.Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We fell into the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:04.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought we were gonna crash into the ice and die.Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:07.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is there no ice in this one spot?Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:09.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Climb up! Get higher!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:13.45,Main,,0,0,0,,This ain't nothing compared to the water torture in Hell!Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:26.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I swear, these Devil Fruit users...Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:15.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!!!Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:20.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!!!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.53,0:07:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I finally found you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.99,0:07:26.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:27.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:31.10,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not who I meant! Who's that huge-faced guy?Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:35.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi'd expect no less from the Navy's full force. They're not to be underestimated.Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:38.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Get ready for me, world!Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:43.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! I'm here to save you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:46.18,Main,,0,0,0,,We're all here to save you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:50.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp! It's your damn family again!Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:55.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! It's not only Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! And even Ivankov from the Revolutionary Army!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:03.19,Main,,0,0,0,,And behind them is a horde of history's most notorious pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,They're the Impel Down escapees!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:10.10,Main,,0,0,0,,The man who everybody talks about. Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw... Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.95,0:08:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not his usual crew, is it?Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:22.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I am so glad you are safe!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to see this, Helmeppo-san!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it? Nothing is gonna surprise me anym-Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:29.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:34.39,Main,,0,0,0,,And I heard he'd been imprisoned in Impel Down! He really is amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.69,0:08:37.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a team he brought with him.Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:43.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd be seeing him again so soon.Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:47.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's the little brother Ace is always talking about.Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:50.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Now we've got all the Warlords here, new and old!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:56.81,Main,,0,0,0,,And that's the troublemaker rookie, Straw Hat?Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Smoker-san, look!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:08:59.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I know.Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.61,0:09:00.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You're mine!Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and Crocodile...Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:07.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they working together?Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's him...Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:14.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Not only is he the grandson of Garp the Hero...Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:16.96,Main,,0,0,0,,he's also the son of the Revolutionary Dragon...Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.84,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll have to eliminate him as well.Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:32.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Of all the things you could have done, you joined forces with Straw Hat Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:35.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this your answer, Jinbe?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! I quit being a Warlord!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:43.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Any way you look at it, that's a strange team...Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:47.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt they all have the same objective.Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,At least, not on this battlefield.Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:05.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Croco-boy?Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:09.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, considering the situation...Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.51,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:17.03,Main,,0,0,0,,He's trying to beat me to it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.19,0:10:21.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocodile is moving in on Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Old Man!Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:25.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You never learn, do you?Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:55.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So you already made preparations to fight me, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.63,0:11:00.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Once you become wet, you can't turn into sand!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:11.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I honored our agreement and helped you get here.Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you defending Whitebeard?Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.74,Main,,0,0,0,,So this old guy really is Whitebeard?Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:18.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Then don't touch him!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace likes this old guy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:24.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good, Ace's brother.Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him near the Old Man!Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:50.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,When a man as great as you came back from the East Blue missing an arm, everyone was surprised.Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:54.68,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What sort of enemy did you give it up to?Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:56.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That left arm of yours.Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.11,0:12:02.89,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I wagered it...Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:03.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,on the new era.Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:07.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Kid... That straw hat of yours...Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:11.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks a lot like the one Red Hair used to wear.Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:15.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You know Shanks, old guy?Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm holding it for Shanks.Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:23.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Look at this, Old Man! This is my little brother!Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:29.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you come to save your brother?Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:30.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:33.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand what you're up against?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:42.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone like you doesn't stand a chance here!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.79,0:12:46.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! That's not for you to decide!Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:52.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I know perfectly well! You wanna be the Pirate King, don't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm going to be the Pirate King, not you!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You're pretty damn cheeky...Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:22.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't show mercy if you slow me down, you spoiled brat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:25.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm doing what I want to do!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.31,0:13:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna save Ace myself!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:31.87,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He's...Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,standing up to Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.17,0:13:35.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.91,0:13:48.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I can execute every one of them, right, Sengoku-san?Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.07,0:13:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:54.11,Main,,0,0,0,,They're moving Ace's execution time up?Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.11,0:13:56.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You're sure that's what they said?Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.38,0:13:59.54,Main,,0,0,0,,After they finish some kind of preparations.Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Then some code stuff I didn't really get.Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:06.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Since you wanna save Ace, too, I thought I'd tell you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:11.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. This is rather important news.Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:13.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry about before.Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:19.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they having such a friendly chat?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:21.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Right!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:23.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace, I'm coming now!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,How is he so confident?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:32.16,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:32.44,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,RubDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.11,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,bDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.11,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.11,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.11,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,-Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.29,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,RDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.29,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.29,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,bDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.47,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,bDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.47,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.47,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.60,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,.Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.60,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,.Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.60,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,.Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:32.62,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,ber-Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:32.80,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,RubDialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:32.93,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,berDialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:33.65,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,...Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:33.86,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:34.15,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,BaDialogue: 2,0:14:33.56,0:14:33.82,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,zDialogue: 2,0:14:33.56,0:14:33.82,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 2,0:14:33.56,0:14:33.82,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 2,0:14:33.56,0:14:34.16,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 2,0:14:33.56,0:14:34.16,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:34.49,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,zooDialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:35.90,Luffy,,0,0,0,fx,kaDialogue: 0,0:14:36.39,0:14:39.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Move it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:41.51,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's Ace's little brother?Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:43.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get in the kid's way!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:46.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Third Division, start your assault!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.53,0:14:49.52,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:54.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:59.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Fourteenth Division, clear his path!Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:01.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes sir, Commander Jil!Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:06.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:11.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Just one man's recklessness got them this riled up?Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:14.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Regardless, this won't alter our plans.Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't lose focus!Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:18.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Proceed as instructed!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.93,0:15:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That Sengoku...Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that he's up against pirates, there's no need to keep the old execution time?Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,These "preparations" he's planning must be the key.Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:34.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Old Man!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.31,0:15:38.22,Main,,0,0,0,,According to a Navy transmission, they're going to accelerate Ace's execution.Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:40.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard.Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:46.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll play right into their plans if we start panicking over this leaked information.Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:51.56,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not sloppy. It's no accident.Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:56.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Not coming from that man.Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:58.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Shove through!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.89,0:16:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Light-speed kicks?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:11.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get carried away. I won't let you through that easily.Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Admiral Kizaru!Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It's you, from Sabaody!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:24.66,Main,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Dragons will be on my case if I let you get away again.Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:26.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.93,0:16:31.97,Main,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat guy's about to die!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:34.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Death Wink!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to turn back and go home now!Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:49.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What, Captain Buggy?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:51.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what you're saying!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:56.81,Main,,0,0,0,,You wanna turn the tables of this battle? Are you serious?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.81,0:16:58.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I...Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:00.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing less from the legendary crew!Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:02.68,Main,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even flinch facing Admiral Kizaru!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, no...Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys only hear what you want to hear!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:08.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat-boy, are vyou alright?Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:10.94,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close! Thanks, Iva-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:15.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It is vmy mission to protect vyou from death!Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:18.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Kizaru again!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, no. That's...Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:22.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Kuma!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:27.12,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the bear-guy who sent us all flying!Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Rolling Aesthe!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.67,0:17:39.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:40.82,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:43.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Even though he's standing over with the other Warlords,Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:48.48,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,he's shooting lasers at vme after all vwe've been through together?Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,How unlucky for you to bump into us.Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:09.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat. This is where it ends for you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:12.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh... Who're you?Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:14.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Fullbody!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I still owe you from the floating restaurant Baratie!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.35,0:18:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah... the guy who got his ass kicked by Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:25.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten these chakrams?Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:28.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you that hypnotist from Usopp's village?Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.99,0:18:30.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:33.65,Main,,0,0,0,,With the Navy's help, I've perfected...Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.65,0:18:35.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Jango-sama's Hypnotism.Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Two chakrams. Twice as effective.Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:42.27,Main,,0,0,0,,With "One, Two, Jango" you will fall asleep.Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:45.17,Main,,0,0,0,,One, two...Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:46.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Jango!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:01.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hina disappointed.Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:04.31,Main,,0,0,0,,You... I met you back in Alabasta!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:06.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have any more time to waste with you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you run.Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:10.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Kimono Sleeve Cage!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:19.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything that passes through my body... is locked tight.Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.04,0:19:21.15,Main,,0,0,0,,There it is, her signature phrase!Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:23.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Now you shall be captivated by Madame Hina!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:25.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of being in cages!Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:26.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear SecondDialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,He's fast!Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.56,0:19:35.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see him!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:38.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Hina negligence.Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:40.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Our negligence too.Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:43.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Madame Hina has bound our bodies and our hearts.Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:45.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:07.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Every single one of these guys is strong!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:14.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.43,0:20:17.23,Main,,0,0,0,,His ability is impressive, as always.Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:18.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I should take his shadow once again, and bring Oars back to life with it.Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.19,0:20:28.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Come out and play, zombie warriors!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:43.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, my minions, go and capture Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Moriah!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:47.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Another tough guy.Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:05.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Have them back!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:11.75,Main,,0,0,0,,There's more!Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course! This is a battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:18.36,Main,,0,0,0,,People dying simply adds to my zombie army!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.65,0:21:20.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Capture Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:22.26,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the culprit behind the prison break!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:24.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep it up!Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.35,0:21:28.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Your opponents are all commissioned officers.Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:31.44,Main,,0,0,0,,How far do you think you will get?Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:35.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:57.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep away, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.59,0:22:15.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You oughta know already!Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.91,0:22:18.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You and I are both pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.52,0:22:21.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You should be out sailing however you want!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.55,0:22:24.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, I have my own adventures!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.42,0:22:28.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, I have my own friends!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.80,0:22:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:35.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You have no right to interfere with that!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:38.88,Main,,0,0,0,,A weakling like you coming to rescue me...Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:39.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Move!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:43.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm gonna let that happen?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That would be too humiliating.Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:49.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Go back, Luffy! Why did you come?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.67,0:22:53.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Please, Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:57.55,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I don't want to take you with me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.28,0:23:01.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is my failure.Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.83,0:23:07.80,Main,,0,0,0,,your brother!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.64,0:23:16.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Didn't ya know?Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.57,0:23:20.16,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,When you exchange sake cups, you become brothers.Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.95,0:23:25.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,From today onward, we are brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:36.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Just then, he definitely said "brother"...Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:37.83,Main,,0,0,0,,That means he is also Roger's...?Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:40.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's parents died after he was born!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.92,0:23:42.73,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can have a younger brother!Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.95,0:23:45.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Those stupid pirate "rules"...Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:48.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of them!Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.55,0:23:49.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.19,0:23:56.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, my zombie minions!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.69,0:24:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sea water?Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.32,0:24:10.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.36,0:24:12.56,Main,,0,0,0,,They're weak against salt.Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.56,0:24:15.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Moriah, those zombies of yours...Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.17,0:24:19.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun, leave the zombies to me.Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.34,0:24:19.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:21.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Knight of the Sea Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.70,0:24:23.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Former member of the Seven Warlords...Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.07,0:24:24.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.44,0:24:28.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It's only one rookie... Don't let him dictate the entire war this way!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.28,0:24:30.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.68,0:24:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll crush him!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.89,0:24:42.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That man will be a danger in the future.Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.29,0:24:46.06,Main,,0,0,0,,He was raised with his sworn brother, Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.06,0:24:51.74,Main,,0,0,0,,But his actual bloodline makes him the son of the Revolutionary, Dragon!Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.74,0:24:53.84,Main,,0,0,0,,The Revolutionary Dragon?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.84,0:24:56.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The son of the world's most fearsome criminal?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.17,0:24:59.03,Main,,0,0,0,,And I know this person!Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.03,0:25:01.01,Main,,0,0,0,,His papa's a big deal!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.01,0:25:02.77,Main,,0,0,0,,He's gone and said it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.77,0:25:03.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san...!Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.15,0:25:07.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.61,0:25:10.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Knowing you're the child of a demon makes me...Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.38,0:25:15.86,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.54,0:25:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I get it now.Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.08,0:25:19.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.62,0:25:35.43,Main,,0,0,0,,That solves the riddle from Loguetown.Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.32,0:25:39.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why Dragon saved him...Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.04,0:25:40.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you just hear that?Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.46,0:25:44.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Dragon... The Dragon?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.33,0:25:46.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Head Office! Head Office!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.02,0:25:47.70,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Sabaody Archipelago.Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.70,0:25:48.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Big news!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.77,0:25:51.06,Main,,0,0,0,,T-Tell the world!Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.10,0:25:54.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We mustn't let him live!Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.30,0:25:57.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Take him down with everything we have!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.31,0:25:59.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine.Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.68,0:26:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no point in hiding it anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.08,0:26:06.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy is already a notorious outlaw. This news won't make any difference now.Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.64,0:26:11.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Raising them as brothers was a big mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.31,0:26:12.39,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.31,0:26:12.96,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,GearDialogue: 2,0:26:12.34,0:26:12.88,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,TDialogue: 2,0:26:12.34,0:26:12.88,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:26:12.34,0:26:12.88,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:26:12.34,0:26:12.88,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:26:12.34,0:26:12.88,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 0,0:26:12.88,0:26:13.43,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,ThirdDialogue: 0,0:26:21.51,0:26:21.59,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.51,0:26:21.87,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,RubDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:21.79,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,bDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:21.79,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:21.79,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:21.79,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,-Dialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:21.97,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,RDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:21.97,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:21.97,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,bDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:22.15,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,bDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:22.15,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:22.15,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:22.28,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,.Dialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:22.28,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,.Dialogue: 2,0:26:21.54,0:26:22.28,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,.Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.79,0:26:22.05,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,ber-Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.97,0:26:22.23,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,RubDialogue: 0,0:26:22.15,0:26:22.36,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,berDialogue: 0,0:26:22.28,0:26:23.08,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,...Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.23,0:26:24.31,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.23,0:26:25.64,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,Giant...Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.57,0:26:26.65,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.57,0:26:30.39,Luffy Gear Third,,0,0,0,fx,RifleDialogue: 0,0:26:37.06,0:26:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.85,0:26:44.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Say whatever the hell you want!Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.58,0:26:47.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm saving you, even if I die!Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.99,0:26:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,That kid.Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.48,0:26:52.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Only Straw Hat could say that to him!Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.76,0:26:54.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We're Ace's family!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.98,0:26:56.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Show us that you can save him!Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.38,0:27:01.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco, don't let him die.Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.39,0:27:03.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger that.Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.58,0:27:11.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...